"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Scan","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO4ScanV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The initial accumulated value to start with.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"initialResult"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A closure that takes the current accumulated value and the next element from the upstream sequence,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and returns a new accumulated value asynchronously."}]}],"name":"nextPartialResult"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An asynchronous sequence that produces each intermediate accumulated result."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator works similarly to Combine’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"scan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" operator. It produces a sequence of values by repeatedly combining a running","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accumulated value with each new element from the upstream async sequence using the provided closure.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is useful for computing running totals, aggregating state, or applying stateful transformations over time."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example demonstrates accumulating a running sum over an asynchronous sequence of integers:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ An async sequence producing the numbers 1 through 5","let numbers = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    for i in 1...5 {","        continuation.yield(i)","    }","    continuation.finish()","}","","\/\/ Use scan to accumulate a running sum","let runningSum = numbers.scan(0) { partialSum, nextNumber in","    return partialSum + nextNumber","}","","\/\/ Consume the running sums","Task {","    for try await sum in runningSum {","        print(sum) \/\/ Prints: 1, 3, 6, 10, 15","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/Scan":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scan"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scan"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/scan","title":"AsyncSequences.Scan","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Scan"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/OutputIn/scan(_:_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/outputin\/scan(_:_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Accumulates state over the elements of an asynchronous sequence, emitting each intermediate accumulated value."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputIn\/scan(_:_:)","kind":"symbol","title":"scan(_:_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"k